{"1674200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alaska Gold Fever", "steam_appid": 1674200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4578230, 4978170, 4518260, 4856070, 4856090, 4856110], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/4357b1db0edf95747c0a19c64214d3c2.avif?t=1787834390\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras_big/4357b1db0edf95747c0a19c64214d3c2.avif?t=1787834390 width=1560 height=458 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mine Gold Like During the Real Gold Rush!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gold mining process inspired by historical methods from the gold rush era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break rocks, collect ore, and separate gold from the soil using various tools and machines. Then smelt it into gold bars that you can sell at the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game you will find different forms of gold:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold dust</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold flakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold nuggets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type has a different value and requires the proper refining process. As you progress through the game, you will unlock better tools and mining techniques.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A System of Mines to Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/11bac16fee7b4e54c860c78383cdf39b.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/11bac16fee7b4e54c860c78383cdf39b.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/11bac16fee7b4e54c860c78383cdf39b.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can discover and explore a total of 9 mines.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 small mines for quick expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 medium mines with branching tunnels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 large multi-level mine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mine has its own unique atmosphere and several to dozens of segments to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working in a mine is dangerous. If you do not place supports correctly, tunnels may collapse. Build reinforcement structures, expand your infrastructure, and explore deeper underground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade Tools and Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/691aa9fbc90c7fce792c9949a6fb6801.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/691aa9fbc90c7fce792c9949a6fb6801.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/691aa9fbc90c7fce792c9949a6fb6801.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tools determine how fast and efficiently you can mine gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create upgraded versions of your equipment and enhance them using rare materials and gemstones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possible upgrades include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >increased tool durability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >faster resource extraction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ability to break harder rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >additional equipment upgrades</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Alaska, 1896 – A Rich Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/d62688db21f7e672432750efb72b1775.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/d62688db21f7e672432750efb72b1775.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/d62688db21f7e672432750efb72b1775.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of people arrive in northern America in search of fortune. Most will return empty-handed. Only a few will make history. Maybe you will be one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Alaska Gold Fever you start as an ordinary gold prospector with simple tools and a big dream. Explore the wild lands of Alaska, mine gold, hunt, develop your businesses, and build an empire at the edge of 19th-century civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you can expect many interesting and engaging storylines as well as unusual characters, such as the Pastor. A large number of fascinating stories and quests await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a main storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hidden treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mysterious locations</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crafting and Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/819f4208e4e48f098bd638f92200355f.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/819f4208e4e48f098bd638f92200355f.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/819f4208e4e48f098bd638f92200355f.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life in Alaska requires strategy and proper preparation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and craft useful items in different workshops such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tool workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >carpentry workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fur workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >campfire and kitchen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparing meals and resting provides bonuses that increase work efficiency, cold resistance, and character stamina.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hunt Wild Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/0581468270afeb05aaf198b91dd7bfa1.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/0581468270afeb05aaf198b91dd7bfa1.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/0581468270afeb05aaf198b91dd7bfa1.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wild nature of Alaska is both a threat and a valuable source of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By hunting animals you can obtain:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >furs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hunting trophies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The quality of the materials you obtain depends on the weapon used and your hunting skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight Extreme Cold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/bf66864e0eb08602ceccb7d3631af978.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/bf66864e0eb08602ceccb7d3631af978.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/bf66864e0eb08602ceccb7d3631af978.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture into the Alaskan wilderness, the lower the temperature becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in the extreme climate you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wear warmer clothing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >prepare proper meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage your energy and stamina</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lack of preparation can quickly end your expedition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Your Own Businesses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f749a3f331bfb8104433832d21af4d11.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f749a3f331bfb8104433832d21af4d11.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f749a3f331bfb8104433832d21af4d11.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold mining is only the beginning. You can develop different ventures and build your own economic empire:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new mines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >farms producing food and milk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a hotel for travelers and gold prospectors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers, manage production, and expand your enterprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Automate Your Mines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f07f41321dea620949ae83f1ca402ef2.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f07f41321dea620949ae83f1ca402ef2.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/f07f41321dea620949ae83f1ca402ef2.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The largest mines can be transformed into real enterprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire miners who will work for you and generate a steady income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to focus on exploration, business development, and discovering new lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/37e181a6adef0ff5fbff39dbbd12e42d.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Mine Gold Like During the Real Gold Rush!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.poster.avif?t=1787834390\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.webm?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674200/extras/ea2d9d28f2c8049e0a6dbe5f99071218.mp4?t=1787834390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gold mining process inspired by historical methods from the gold rush era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break rocks, collect ore, and separate gold from the soil using various tools and machines. Then smelt it into gold bars that you can sell at the bank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game you will find different forms of gold:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold dust</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold flakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gold nuggets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type has a different value and requires the proper refining process. As you progress through the game, you will unlock better tools and mining techniques.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A System of Mines to Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl